Package: SimpleRIMEReport
Type: Package
Title: Create Simple RIME report
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Who wrote it
Maintainer: Ashley Sawle <Ashley.Sawle@cruk.cam.ac.uk>
Description: The package takes the protein and peptide outputs from Proteome
    Discover for a simple RIME experiment and generates a report in the form of
    an Excel workbook. The package is able to combine the results for multiple
    samples, with multiple pull downs, into a single report. A negative
    control (e.g. IgG) is required in order to filter out non-specific
    binding.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
Depends: 
    R (>= 2.10)
